# Preservation artifacts — byte-exact fidelity is the point of this directory.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, and a fresh
# clone would produce files that do NOT hash to the SHA256 values documented in
# README.md §6 and §7. -text disables all end-of-line conversion in both
# directions, so what is checked out is byte-identical to what was preserved.
#
# Do not remove. Do not add files here that are meant to be editable.

* -text
